  "title": "SET_OPTIONS fails with SET_OPTIONS_AUTH_REVOCABLE_REQUIRED",
  "pattern": "A transaction whose SET_OPTIONS operation fails at apply is still written into the closed ledger: its fee is charged, its sequence number is consumed, and none of its operations change state. The result carries the operation's result code (auth_revocable_required). Readers that skip failed transactions lose the fee and sequence change; readers that assume a failed transaction changed something record effects that never happened.",
